# Google Search Console verification.
# Cloudflare Pages auto-strips .html extensions with a 308, so
# /googled08dc82430d1ce9f.html redirects to the extensionless path.
# An extensionless file with the same content lives beside it, and this
# rule keeps the SPA catch-all below from swallowing either form.
/googled08dc82430d1ce9f.html   /googled08dc82430d1ce9f   200

# SPA fallback. Must stay LAST - it matches everything, so any path that
# needs to serve real content has to be listed above it.
/*    /index.html   200
